[{"client_msg_id":"785ca064-1374-40d1-b58a-0a12d4e90b2f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"常温核融合事件のドキュメンタリー見てるけど面白い","ts":"1632317301.023200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8fkm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a14dc2f-9fa1-4ced-8cb2-86ad446678d5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://www.google.com/amp/www4.nhk.or.jp/P3442/|https://www.google.com/amp/www4.nhk.or.jp/P3442/\u003e","ts":"1632317282.022500","attachments":[{"fallback":"フランケンシュタインの誘惑　科学史 闇の事件簿 - NHK: フランケンシュタインの誘惑　科学史 闇の事件簿","id":1,"title":"フランケンシュタインの誘惑　科学史 闇の事件簿","title_link":"https://www.google.com/amp/www4.nhk.or.jp/P3442/","text":"科学は、人間に夢を見せる一方で、ときに残酷な結果をつきつける。 理想の人間を作ろうとした青年フランケンシュタインが、怪物を生み出してしまったように― 輝かしい科学の歴史の陰には、残酷な実験や非人道的な研究、不正が数多くあった。 そんな闇に埋もれた事件に光を当て、「科学」「歴史」「倫理」に迫るシリーズ。","image_url":"https://www.nhk.jp/static/assets/images/tvseries/ts/11Q1LRN1R3/11Q1LRN1R3-eyecatch_94148729f914b72a4ce1e322da599752.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"フランケンシュタインの誘惑　科学史 闇の事件簿 - NHK","service_icon":"https://www.nhk.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://www.google.com/amp/www4.nhk.or.jp/P3442/","original_url":"https://www.google.com/amp/www4.nhk.or.jp/P3442/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eo4DC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"24f05fb6-3675-4c8a-bbcb-c05b46f8d335","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"単に熱移動しないというだけ","ts":"1632276171.021600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1ASG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebd90d12-506b-459f-be36-5dcf01bd4d09","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"冷却機能はない (ほしい)","ts":"1632276166.021300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V+s"}]},{"client_msg_id":"138d8a01-d4d8-47fd-a7b8-1a3c2a45d7cb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01844Y1FD2/p1632270887002300\u003e\nこれに関していうと、日光でめちゃくちゃ人間は熱いけど、雪は冷たいままという意味です!","ts":"1632276126.020900","attachments":[{"fallback":"[September 21st, 2021 5:34 PM] dotmapu: それは反射率高いとこあるくと日光が辛いと言う話です？","id":1,"author_id":"U01D9BALEKU","author_name":"KosukeMizuno","author_subname":"KosukeMizuno","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U01D9BALEKU","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2020-10-25/1444669637702_3879d2ec21d7f1fee9ad_48.jpg","text":"それは反射率高いとこあるくと日光が辛いと言う話です？","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #hobby-science","ts":1632270887.002300,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01844Y1FD2/p1632270887002300","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01844Y1FD2/p1632270887002300"}],"edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1632276133.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desuyone","count":2,"users":["U01D9BALEKU","U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HVy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e6ebb12-1dcc-44be-a462-1db4b5579684","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"メディアなんだから分かる人にちゃんと聞きにいけよくらいは思ってしまいますね","ts":"1632273501.020200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ghe7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dd71581e-f99a-4343-8fad-4cd74725e5b0","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"itmediaの記事、最後のほうで専門家に議論があるみたいなこと書いてあるのはちょっとおかしいな…\n野口さんはこの分野の専門家じゃないし\ntwitterの雑談を専門家が疑義を唱えている、みたいな書き方されたら困るだろう","ts":"1632273306.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0fa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b16d0a29-58ae-475e-b976-69419885eaf1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー(読み落とし)","ts":"1632273190.016700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"32U"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec9a2f39-a2ff-48c9-afcc-fa7a617b7766","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"itmediaの記事はちゃんとそう書いてあるな…（読み落とし）","ts":"1632273101.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LhY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da0b4559-ebc4-4aaf-88f5-1d1794afd3ba","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"この現象そもそも反射だけで語れないのなーこれがミスリーディングな要因っぽい\n可視光域の低吸収率と300K黒体放射（赤外域）の高効率が両方必要","ts":"1632272862.015700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=QK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8891bc83-98ab-4b55-9c29-8b1dc6dcfd71","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"可視光反射率と赤外光放射率が両方高いのがポイントですね","ts":"1632272724.013400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BFx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0735c951-59cd-4d55-a36c-11c43ba1451c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"\u003chttps://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/news157.html\u003e\nこっちの例だと赤外でも反射をいままでよりよくやることで冷えている状態になりえるってところか(受けない + 他で普通に冷える分くらい?)","ts":"1632272327.012600","attachments":[{"fallback":"ITmedia NEWS: 塗るだけで表面が冷える？　世界一白い塗料がギネス記録に　太陽光の98.1％を反射","id":1,"title":"塗るだけで表面が冷える？　世界一白い塗料がギネス記録に　太陽光の98.1％を反射","title_link":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/news157.html","text":"米パデュー大学の研究チームが開発した白い塗料が、世界で最も白い塗料としてギネス記録に認定された。この塗料は地球温暖化を抑制することを目的に開発されたもので、この塗料を塗った部分は、周囲よりも冷えるという。","thumb_url":"https://image.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/cover_news157.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"ITmedia NEWS","service_icon":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/favicon.ico","thumb_width":800,"thumb_height":450,"from_url":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/news157.html","original_url":"https://www.itmedia.co.jp/news/articles/2109/21/news157.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pcv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9709acf-065a-43af-9f6a-48e86d4f9251","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"スノーボールアースとかと同じ、アルベドが高いって話かな?\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%99%E3%83%89\u003e","ts":"1632272304.012000","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: アルベド","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"アルベド","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%99%E3%83%89","text":"アルベド（albedo）とは、天体の外部からの入射光に対する、反射光の比である。反射能（はんしゃのう）とも言う。アルベードとも表記する。\n0以上、1前後以下（1を超えることもある）の無次元量であり、0 – 1の数値そのままか、0 % – 100 %の百分率で表す。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%99%E3%83%89","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%83%99%E3%83%89"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vq=4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d0e07e0-ed73-44ed-9a33-3c70c36ea803","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"可視光での反射がいいことと、赤外線での放射吸収がいいは両立はすることはあるけど...","ts":"1632272233.011000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s7d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1c9959a4-6179-41d3-80bd-3c5f0414a880","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"ちゃんとした説明を読みたい","ts":"1632271447.010400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nAPwE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3065303b-ef2f-4eae-8240-7e0c429f8b68","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"物体内で熱平衡化することで可視光の入力エネルギーを赤外光として放出できる、赤外の熱浴は宇宙空間なので「周囲温度」が低いとみなせる\nの2点によるものだと理解した\n（反射率というか放出率じゃねと思うけど、かなり繋がりありそう）","ts":"1632271420.009900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DIr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4545dfb0-5f67-4ae1-8d72-0b9e81118746","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"（まあツイートだけだと完全には納得してないのですが）","ts":"1632271047.005800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/XB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"555c84ca-6223-41fd-a229-437c89d06503","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"たぶんそういう話ではなく\nいくら反射率が高くなったところで冷えるのはおかしいのです\nエネルギー収支が釣り合わないので","ts":"1632270968.004000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0WutC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96776602-7c2c-41b9-ae21-10a49cfc62db","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"それは反射率高いとこあるくと日光が辛いと言う話です？","ts":"1632270887.002300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2UQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56e6fa0b-773b-4612-a13c-15f30a5c88ce","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"雪が凍ったまま、上を歩く人間が猛暑を体験する","ts":"1632270654.001500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+jH7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d59ad39-2822-4170-9819-773383a75bbc","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"雪山とかもわかりやすい","ts":"1632270625.001000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rV+2M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f4eeb38d-6169-4e53-baae-b48c83bc89aa","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"白すぎる塗料が冷える仕組み","ts":"1632270544.000800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kVR5n"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae835566-3806-4327-b4d7-03a776f7d2b8","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/active_galactic/status/1440255083455803400?s=19|https://twitter.com/active_galactic/status/1440255083455803400?s=19\u003e","ts":"1632270530.000200","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/active_galactic|@active_galactic\u003e: 可視域で非常に反射率の高い白色塗料を塗った物体が冷えるのは熱力学に反しているように見えるかも知れないが、赤外域では大気のそこそこ透明な帯域がいくつもあるので（晴れている場合）塗料表面が赤外線をやりとりする相手は上層大気や宇宙空間だったりする。昼でも放射冷却が勝つほどに白い。","id":1,"author_name":"ACTIVE GALACTIC","author_subname":"@active_galactic","author_link":"https://twitter.com/active_galactic/status/1440255083455803400","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/739703158/_____normal.jpg","text":"可視域で非常に反射率の高い白色塗料を塗った物体が冷えるのは熱力学に反しているように見えるかも知れないが、赤外域では大気のそこそこ透明な帯域がいくつもあるので（晴れている場合）塗料表面が赤外線をやりとりする相手は上層大気や宇宙空間だったりする。昼でも放射冷却が勝つほどに白い。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1632218545,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/active_galactic/status/1440255083455803400?s=19","original_url":"https://twitter.com/active_galactic/status/1440255083455803400?s=19"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9VCvf"}]}]
